window.products.push({"id":510105,"name":"Patriotic Glass Sun Tea Jar - Great for Summer and Fourth of July Home Decor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xgkOSpY0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Showing patriot pride sure does break a sweat! Lucky for you, this jug keeps you cool in Uncle Sam-approved fashion. Perfect for Fourth of July party supplies, this sun tea jug comes decorated with a starry pattern. It's perfect for serving practically any beverage while laying poolside or chilling and grilling in the backyard. You know what goes good with lemonade or tea? A side of American spirit, of course! Glass with plastic lid and handle. 10\"","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xgkOSpY0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fun Express","source_asin":"B07Q2LDPTL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-510105","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Q2LDPTL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Q2LDPTL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":510106,"name":"TEKNOTEL 2 PCS Shower Caddy 4 PCS Adhesive Sticker Replacement Hook, for Shower Caddy Bathroom Rack Shelf Soap Dish Basket Wall Hanging Hook with Stro","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bVoWN9zEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Rustproof The shower wall shelves can do a better job if you stick it on smooth and sturdy surface like: tiles, plastic, metal, glass and wood surface, DON'T recommend install it on easy-peel-off surface such as cement wall and Painted Wall. Please attach the adhesive pad to the wall and wait for 3 hours before before hanging items. This corner shelf with double sided transparent traceless adhesive Tape - Stronger than ordinary Double Sided Adhesive Tape and Suction cups. Hold up to 22 lbs. The shelf can be dismantled and adjusted according to your needs. It can be recycled and reuse after you take it from adhesive hooks 100% SATISFACTION - We provide Quality Service by 2 years. When you need to move, please contact us for more adhesives. If you have any quality issue, please let us know.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bVoWN9zEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TEKNOTEL","source_asin":"B0BDZSPYV3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-510106","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BDZSPYV3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BDZSPYV3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":510107,"name":"TAIDEA Two Stage Carbide & Ceramic Grit Kitchen Knife Sharpener T1206TC","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51QL4TtZnPL._SL1001_.jpg","description":"Using introduction: 1. Place the knife sharpener on a stable surface when using. one or both of the following steps depending on how blunt the blade is. Step 1: Coarse sharpening Use this only if your knife is very blunt. Place knives on the coarse stage. Using slight downward pressure, run the blade from its heel to its point through the slot. Repeat three times. Once every six months or as required. Step 2: Fine honing Always finish off with this step to remove any burrs that result from the re-edging and rough honing process. Without using pressure, run the blade through the fine slot ceramic rods three to five times. You can also use this step on its own to maintain a sharp blade. It is recommended to do it approximately once a week or daily use. 2. After using the knife sharpener, carefully wipe the knife blade with a damp cloth or rinse under running water and dry thoroughly. Clean the knife sharpener with non-abrasive brush. Caution: 1. Do not use the knife sharpener to sharpen serrated blades or scissors. 2. To avoid damaging the knife, please sharpen the knife slightly and don't sharpen back and forth. 3. The ceramic rods may discolor. This is normal. 4. Do not put the sharpener in the dishwasher or submerge in water. 5. Please put the knife sharpener and knife beyond the reach of children to avoid any accidents.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51QL4TtZnPL._SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TAIDEA","source_asin":"B013SJMULG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-510107","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B013SJMULG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B013SJMULG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":510108,"name":"Morning Sail I Blue by Silvia Vassileva, 14x14-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.09,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Ke-uWupwL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features a soft, pastel painting of three sailboats. Silvia Vassileva pursued her love of art at the Academy of fine art in Bulgaria, where she earned both her bachelor's and master's degrees. She spent six years painting and exhibiting her work in Japan before moving to the U.S. Silvia describes her style as very free and bold. She makes her paintings come alive by using contrast and unusual color palettes. Silvia's home studio, which she designed herself, is bright, contemporary and minimalist. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Ke-uWupwL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B075ST78VS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-510108","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B075ST78VS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B075ST78VS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
