window.products.push({"id":510137,"name":"Cool Mist Oscillating Ultrasonic Humidifier | 120-Degree Rotation, 1 Gallon Tank, 48 Hour Runtime, Nightlight | Clean Tank Technology, BONUS DEMINERAL","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/313snn7b99L._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description HoMedics is committed to helping you create a healthy home environment to relax your body, de-stress your mind, and simplify your life. Founded in 1987, we are a trusted leader in health and wellness. Our brand is widely recognized for home massage products and continues to be the leading innovator in massage technology. Additionally, we carry a full line of in-home wellness products , including air filters, humidifiers, white noise machines, aroma diffusers, and more. The Ultrasonic Cool Mist Humidifier brings a cool and refreshing breathing experience to your home. HoMedics Ultrasonic Mister is the perfect size for bedrooms, nurseries, offices, cubicles, and living rooms. The innovative on/off oscillating head allows you to choose between a 120-degree motorized swivel or a targeted nozzle in one fixed direction. The wide 120-degree coverage allows for a total air purification and circulation of your space. The ultrasonic technology allows this mister to have a super-quiet operation. You won’t disturb co-workers. Your children won’t be woken up in the middle of the night from a noisy motor. It also has a built-in nightlight with a soothing glow to allow easier navigation during the night. Just one gallon of water gets the HoMedics humidifier running for up to 48 hours . For your convenience, this mister will shut down when it gets too low on water. Using high mineral content hard water may cause a white mineral residue to accumulate on surfaces in the room near the humidifier. The mineral residue is commonly called “white dirt.” Drop the included demineralization cartridge into your tank to help reduce the potential for white dirt. From the Manufacturer Elegant design and modern style--can be placed on the floor or a table to blend perfectly with your home decor. view larger 120-degree oscillating head provides wide coverage throughout the room. view larger Adjustable mist control, nightlight option, and on/off oscillation. view larger Ultrasonic Cool Mist Oscillating Humidifier Create the Ideal Room Climate for Healthier Breathing With its sleek, innovative design, this UHE-OC1 cool-mist humidifier from HoMedics makes it easy to enhance humidity levels in small- to medium-sized rooms. The unit's elegant profile and modern style allows it to blend perfectly with existing home decor, whether placed on the floor or a side table. For cool-mist distribution throughout the room, the humidifier comes equipped with a 120-degree motorized oscillating head. The oscillating function can also be turned off, allowing the nozzle to be set in one fixed direction. Perfect for Bedrooms The UHE-OC1 cool-mist humidifier features ultrasonic technology, which means virtually silent operation--perfect for a nursery or bedroom. The unit provides micro-fine mist, which is easily absorbed into the air, and there's no filter to ever clean or change. Adjust the amount of mist output by turning the control knob from low to medium or high. The humidifier also provides a built-in night light for a soothing glow and easier navigation in the dark. Easy-to-Fill One-Gallon Tank For easy filling, the humidifier's one-gallon tank removes effortlessly from the base. On a full tank, the humidifier will run for up to 48 hours before needing to be refilled. Best of all, the humidifier will shut off automatically if the water tank runs dry, offering added safety and peace of mind. Clean Mist Technology The UHE-OC1 cool-mist humidifier also features Clean Mist technology that helps avoid growth of micro-particles on the surface of the tank. A demineralization cartridge comes included to eliminate white dirt caused by hard water. Highlights Innovative on/off oscillating head Innovative on/off oscillating head Clean Mist technology helps keep the tank clean Clean Mist technology helps keep the tank clean Easy-to-remove and fill 1-gallon tank Easy-to-remove and fill 1-gallon tank Up to 48 hours run time per filling Up to 48 hours run time per filling Ultrasonic technology for virtually silent operation Ultrasonic technology for virtually silent operation Built-in night light Built-in night light Adjustable mist control Adjustable mist control Auto shut-off protection when the tank is empty Auto shut-off protection when the tank is empty HoMedics Home Environment Humidifiers UHE-CM15 UHE-CM25 UHE-OC1 UHE-OW14 Room Size Perfect for home or office Small to medium rooms Small to medium rooms Large rooms Run Time (on a full tank) Up to 10 hours Up to 24 hours Up to 48 hours Up to 60 hours Ultrasonic Technology Yes Yes Yes Yes Mist Output 1-speed Adjustable Adjustable Adjustable Water-Tank Capacity 650 ml (1.4 pint) 1 gallon 1 gallon 1.4 gallon Clean Mist Technology -- Yes Yes Yes Built-in Night Light -- Yes (on/off option) Yes -- Auto Shut-off Protection -- Yes Yes Yes Demineralization Cartridge Included -- Yes Yes Yes Dimensions 3.65\" x 3.65\" x 7.5\" 8.72\" x 8.68\" x 12.23\" 9.6\" x 8.75\" x 17.5\" 9.25\" x 10\" x 24.75\"","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/313snn7b99L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Homedics","source_asin":"B082RLZFQX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-510137","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082RLZFQX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B082RLZFQX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
