window.products.push({"id":510210,"name":"HAYI Coffee Mug Warmer, Smart Temperature Electric Coffee Warmer for Desk Settings Cup Sensing Touch Control Tech for Home Office","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51QqAGvvgCL._AC_SL1145_.jpg","description":"2020 New Design Smart Beverage Warmer Give you a s a great choice for keeps your body warm all day, great helper to great a better life. It is medically proved that drinking water coffee beverages at appropriate warm temperature is good for health. This coffee warmer is convenient and portable.And also Popular for Birthday,Christmas,Thanksgiving Days Gift. Pass your love and concern to your family members and friends. Keep Your Drinks Warm Anytime You Want: Perfect for coffee, tea, hot cocoa, soup, solid oil, liquid, baby food,milk tea & more (55 Degree C is best for drink ). It can also be used as candle wax warmer plate. Precautions: ?1.The glass panel is hot after use, please do not touch ?2.Do not let children or pets come into touch with it to avoid burns. ?3.Wipe cleanly with a damp cloth only, Do not immerse the appliance in water. ?4.When not in use for a long time, please Remove the plug or turn off the power. How to use(The insulation effect of different cups is not the same) 1. The bottom of the cup remains dry before use. 2. Connect the power cord to the 110V-240V power supply. 3.Touch the button to activate the glass panel, When you first time touch the button and turn on the power, it is in standby(the pink light flashes) After the second touch, the indicator light turns red(high temperature). And the third touch, the indicator light turns blue(low temperature) After the fourth touch, the indicator light goes out, indicating that the glass panel is closed. Specification Material: Aluminum magnesium alloy, glass panel Voltage: AC 110V-240V-, 50HZ Output Power: 18W Color: Black","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51QqAGvvgCL._AC_SL1145_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HAYI","source_asin":"B08QN37Z3T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-510210","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08QN37Z3T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08QN37Z3T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
