window.products.push({"id":510258,"name":"yescool Weighted Blanket with Removable Cover, Weighted Blanket Queen Size 20lbs 60\"x80\"for Adults, Heavy Blanket with Minky Duvet Cover,Warm Cozy Thi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":70.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ZiUkqPQUL._AC_.jpg","description":"🏆[NECESSARY HOW] Weighted blanket with removable cover, sounds like dream come true. A weighted blanket for kids/adults without duvet cover is irritated somehow. Hassled by slippery queen weighted blankets continuously? Worried about stains or wear & tear ruining your heavy blanket? Pissed off with glass leakage after the first wash? A Weighted blanket with cover tackles all of them! Tranquility weighted blanket are a must, a removable cover keeping you warm in winter makes it even better. 🏆 [HOW TO CHOOSE] Pick the blanket weight that is roughly 8-12% of your total body weight, plus or minus 1 to 2 pounds depending on your physical strength. 20 lbs weighted blanket queen is suitable for adults weighing about 180-230 lbs, weighted blanket queen size is suitable for double beds. If you need help choosing the right size, feel free to contact us. We'll be more than happy to help! Weighted lap blankets for sofa, meditation, yoga, even office or lounging at home. Machine wash in cold water at a gentle speed, dry clean and air dry hang dry or flat dry. 🏆 [SWALLOWING HUG] Calming weighted blankets for adults/kids aren’t there for nothing. The soft pressure fits your body curvature, and swallow you in his calming sweet hug. If a nice warm hug is your thing, then that’s it. Natural glass beads inside evenly distributed in every single small compartment calm your nerve down. Heavy blanket for sleeping features deep pressure: reducing tossing and turning 96% so you could sleep longer and deeper, and wake up more rested & juiced up. 🏆[UPGRADED HOW] Blue heavy weighted blanket- The A-side is 100% bamboo fiber and B-side is 100% cotton. The bamboo side is cooling, It regulates your body temperature, perfect for use in summer and hot-climate areas. The cotton side is soft and breathable, suitable for all seasons with a delicate dot design. These gorgeous dots make a three-dimensional view, adding cozy schemes to your bedroom decor. 8 corner ties assure your breathable weighted blanket won’t bunch up or slip away. Yescool duvet cover owns smaller square stitching （10 stitches/inches）than other weighted blankets with cover （16 stitches/inches), making the glass beads stay in place & leave you zero-leakage-worry. 🏆[SEND A HUG] Looking for unique gifts for adults man/woman, that’s it. One of those 31 gifts for adults! For family members or your friends, nothing would be more decent than a cozy dream which could be used all year round. Besides that, weight blankets with removable covers are great gifts for people enjoying hugs. If you couldn’t be there for your friends every single minute, send this for your friend means send him/her a hug: an intimate hug, touching & pushing every inch of the body softly.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ZiUkqPQUL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"yescool","source_asin":"B097DVT6FN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-510258","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B097DVT6FN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B097DVT6FN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":510259,"name":"POLYTE Oversize, 60 x 30 in, Quick Dry Lint Free Microfiber Bath Towel Set, 6 Piece (Beige)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.89,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91A+fhZG3SL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"If we may, would you care for some blissful bath towels? We created them just for you, so you can experience a SPA-LIKE quality in your own home--with a COZY and SUPER SOFT feeling on the skin without the heft and bulk. They are infused with SUPER ABSORBENT properties to effectively dry your body and hair. Washcloths are infused with GENTLE EXFOLIATING properties to effectively remove dead skin cells--simply dampen with water. SUPERIOR LATHER with bar soaps or body washes. Towels, themselves, DRY QUICKLY to RESIST ODORS.Allow us to share how to EASILY CARE for these blissful towels. Recommend washing separately to prevent collecting lint or debris from other garments and textiles. Please hand or machine wash in warm water with like colors and air dry or dry on the low setting. Recommend using wool dryer balls to reduce any static when drying. We ask you not use fabric softener, bleach, dryer sheets or the towels may become less blissful. Can also launder in a laundry bag to keep separated from mixed loads and away from debris.Recommend using towels to pat dry your body and not wipe dry. Key Product Features Size Large: bath towel - 30 inches by 60 inches or 76.2 cm by 152 cm, hand towel - 16 inches by 30 inches or 40.64 cm by 76.2 cm, washcloth - 13 inches by 13 inches or 33 cm by 33 cm Weave: dual pile terry Edges/Trim: satin with rounded corners Includes: 2 bath towels, 2 hand towels, 2 washcloths Classification: DeluxePolyte Microfiber Classifications:Standard <300 gsmPremium = 300 - 349 gsmProfessional = 350 - 399 gsmDeluxe > 399 gsm","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91A+fhZG3SL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"POLYTE","source_asin":"B09877GC7L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-510259","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09877GC7L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09877GC7L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
