window.products.push({"id":510409,"name":"Dumpling Maker, 4 Pack Dumpling Mold Set for Making Pies, Ravioli, Dumpling Press (3/3.74/4.9/6 in)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/01RmK+J4pJL._AC_.gif","description":"Dumpling Press is a great helper for you and your children when making dumpling,pierogi, ravioli, pot sticker, etc. What you need to do is just fill, fold and press to seal a perfect dumpling. You will never worry about making ugly dumplings again, especially for dumplings serve as a gift to friends. Material: Food grade PP material Size: 3/3.74/4.9/6 in; Package Included: ✔ 1* Dumpling Maker(3 in) ✔ 1* Dumpling Maker(3.74in) ✔ 1* Dumpling Maker(4.9in) ✔ 1* Dumpling Maker(6in)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/01RmK+J4pJL._AC_.gif","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Persier","source_asin":"B07ZRH9GSR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-510409","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07ZRH9GSR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07ZRH9GSR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":510410,"name":"Oncor 4.5ft Eco-Friendly Aspen Fir Christmas Tree","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81lBV6v6TiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Featuring our Aspen Fir's slimmer profile, this Eco-Friendly Oncor 4.5ft Aspen Fir Christmas Tree is a great alternative for those wanting a smaller option or to save space. With an eco-friendly hook tree design and a plastic stand, this tree stores conveniently into its compact storage box. THIS TREE: HOOK Hinge trees are faster to set up and come in 1-3 trunk sections plus a tree top. Hook trees require branch assembly but can offer a more relaxed shaping experience and are more eco-friendly as they use less packaging and shipping resources. Want to know more? We now also offer assembly videos on YouTube. MADE OF RECYCLED PLASTIC  All Oncor trees are made of 100% recycled PVC plastic, thereby reducing the use of fossil fuels in the production process and reusing resources. All our trees are made from non-toxic PVC with tin-based stabilizers instead of lead. Supplementing regular lab tests under US CPSC and EN71 standards, testings are conducted internally at least 10 times each production day with a Hitachi XRF Analyzer. Inherently fire resistant, PVC is the only general-purpose plastic that does not require the addition of flame retardant chemicals. CHRISTMAS TREE SPECIALISTS  As one of the world's oldest Christmas tree manufacturers, Oncor has been manufacturing unlit artificial Christmas trees since 1980. We accept returns with no restocking fees and free return shipping within 30 days or until Dec 21st. Using specialist knowledge and innovative production techniques along with the best quality raw materials, our highly-skilled colleagues craft eco-friendly Christmas trees with industry-leading product lives that we offer direct to consumers. Have a question about artificial Christmas trees? Send it our way! SUSTAINABILITY  As a member of 1% for the Planet and Green America, we commit to sustainable business. Therefore, we donate at least 1% of gross sales to 1%FTP-approved non-profit environmental organizations.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81lBV6v6TiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Oncor","source_asin":"B078JZN8C7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-510410","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B078JZN8C7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B078JZN8C7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":510411,"name":"KATE POSH - Best Dog Ever Engraved Grey Leather Picture Frame - Dog Lover Gifts, Christmas Gifts, Dog Memorial Gifts, Birthday Gifts, Dog Paws and Bon","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61L-0j5Ee5L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Every pet owner is biased when it comes to their animal. Looking for a gift for someone with a dog? They will love this frame that reads \"Best Dog Ever\" with a paw print design. What a great way to congratulate someone on their new pet or perhaps someone is having a doggy birthday. You may even want this frame to show off a photo of your own lovable canine. Every dog lover needs this frame to showcase their favorite furry friend.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61L-0j5Ee5L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KATE POSH","source_asin":"B078ZT9H15","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-510411","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B078ZT9H15","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B078ZT9H15","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":510412,"name":"St Saint Bridget/Brigid and Patrick Medal Blessed by Pope Benedict XVI with Holy Card Patron Saint of Babies","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/416Bs6rIuOL._AC_.jpg","description":"This medal was Blessed by Pope Benedict XVI on the 3rd Sunday of Easter, 30 April 2006 at the Vatican in Rome, Italy. A laminated parchment of the Blessing given is included. I am not selling the Blessing. The blessing I give to you. Also because this item was Blessed at a Sunday Mass held in Saint Peter's Square there is no audience ticket given out. I am including a copy of the Official Sermon given by Pope Benedict XVI on this Sunday entitled \"Regina Caeli\" which was put out by the Vatican on 30 April 2006. Also included is a copy of the Regina Caeli ( Queen of Heaven) prayer that was said by Pope Benedict XVI in conjunction with his sermon along with a photo card of the Pope and a velour bag. Unfortunately there are sellers on Amazon whom claimed their items are Blessed when they aren't. To verify that an item is Blessed look for documentation on a seller's listing such as a ticket from the Audience at the Vatican which has a number only the seller can have or if a item is blessed at a sermon then ask to see a custom slip issued by the USPS or from Italy which shows that the items have been in Italy at the time they claimed they were blessed.. One cannot get items in and out of Italy without a custom slip detailing what a person is bringing to or from whether it is one item or a hundred. If they can't provide one then the items haven't been blessed. Also it should be noted that the Vatican does not issue Certificates of Authenticity for items that are Blessed by the Pope. Also if they claim they go to Italy quite frequently ask to see their passport which would have the information on when they went. If they refuse to show you then it would be questionable if a Papal Blessing was obtained as claimed. I also recommend checking out their other listings to see what kind of items they sell which can say alot about the seller. Plus get their real name not their username. I always google a seller's real name if I question whether their items truly are blessed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/416Bs6rIuOL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Catholic Direct","source_asin":"B004MSAEYS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-510412","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004MSAEYS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004MSAEYS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
