window.products.push({"id":510453,"name":"Guojanfon 4 Pieces Toilet Cover Toilet Seat Cover Pads with Handle Toilet Lid Cover Cushion Thicker Bathroom Soft Toilet Seat Cover Soft Thicker Stret","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Hx4wrvs2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Stretchable Washable Toilet Cover Fits Various of Toilet Seats  Each toilet cover has a cute little pattern, which adds a unique decorative effect to your toilet. Four different designs allow you to clean and replace at any time according to your mood, keeping your toilet clean and hygienic at the same time.  High quality: Toilet seat cover pads are made of high-quality stretchable acrylic fibers, they are very soft, comfortable and elastic, so you can stretch toilet lid cover cushion at will and mount them precisely on the toilet, there interior has a hose-like shape, but the hose is detachable and can be removed if not needed.  Warm and comfortable: The toilet cover is suitable for spring, autumn and winter. The soft plush material perfectly fits the skin, giving you a different comfortable experience when going to the toilet.  The Toilet cover reusable,not disposable toilet seat cover. Both machine and hand washable, easy to fast dry.however,for the health of you and your family, we recommend that you clean the toilet seat cushion mat regularly and replace it with a new one, as the toilet tends to accumulate bacteria and dirt. First place the toilet mat from under the seat cushion, then flip the toilet mats from the inside out, and finally place the toilet lid completely on the seat cushion. The toilet seat cushion themselves are flexible, they can be used with most round and U-shaped toilet seats, It is suitable for most toilet size,so you don't have to worry about size issues.( Please check the size carefully before buying)  Easy to install and use: Step 1: Take out the toilet seat cover pads (after receiving the toilet pad, you can wash it before use); Step 2: Insert the plastic fixing ring attached to the toilet seat to the toilet seat to fix it on the toilet seat; Step 3: Cover the toilet seat cushion from bottom to top, and adjust the size to fit the toilet properly; Step 4: When cleaning is needed, it can be easily removed by pulling the rope gently.  Material: High quality fiber Size: Stretch to 14\"x 18\" Diameter: 12 inches (30cm) Color: Blue with gray, Green with gray, Beige with gray, Pink with gray Package:4 Pieces toilet seat covers","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Hx4wrvs2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Guojanfon","source_asin":"B0BHVWB8Q9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-510453","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BHVWB8Q9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BHVWB8Q9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
