window.products.push({"id":510459,"name":"Cool Mist Humidifiers, Humuge 5L Humidifiers for Bedroom Super Quiet, 3 Mist Levels Humidity, 360° Rotation Nozzle, Remote Control, Top Fill Air Humid","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":62.89,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61N1xuZDKaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【House Warming Gifts】Are you still picking a surprise Valentine's Day gift? Humidifier is suitable for hot summer and unusually dry winter, Humidifiers can increase the humidity of the air, purify the environment, moisturize the skin, add essential oils, relax the body and mind, chase away fatigue. Especially suitable for holiday gifts for friends and family. Care for your loved ones, give them a surprise practical gift! 【TOP-FILL DESIGN - FAST HUMIDIFICATION 】5L Large water tank leakproof humidifiers for bedroom, Large room air humidifier, can work in room as large as 428ft² and last for up to 50 hours, No need to add water frequently, you can enjoy a full night's sleep, Cold Mist Humidifiers for kids Nursery & Whole House and necessities of plants. 【BEST HUMIDIFIER FOR BEDROOM】Lying in bed, using the Remote Control to settings timing, 3 adjustable spray levels, led night light, sleep mode etc. Humanized design, convenient using experience（Remote control distance of 1-2M）. the humidifier will raise RH 12% in 30mins. Enjoy the soft night lights, and the Sleep Mode will give you an optimal sleep-humidifying environment. 【2-IN-1 HUMIDIFIER DIFFUSER】Pull out the tray on the bottom of the humidifiers and then add whatever essential oil you like to the cotton pad. 360° Rotating nozzle ensures an even distribution of moisture throughout the room,Helping to relieve dry skin and enjoy the fragrance brought by the cool mist humidifier,Let you relax every inch of your skin, getting rid of the fatigue of the day. 【QUIET AND SAFE - SLEEP MODE】 With a quiet setting of less than 30dB, our ultrasonic bedroom humidifier keeps the humidity in your room stable while you sleep and will help you create a good night's sleep without distractions. When the water runs out, it has an auto shut-off function that is perfect for your baby and pets. 【EASY TO USE & CLEAN】Top-Refilling and removable Water Tank Design, you don't have to move the air humidifier around. open the top cover, water through the wide mouth directly into the water tank, can be cleaned directly under the faucet, very easy to clean and maintain.1 year warranty, 24-hour customer service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61N1xuZDKaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Humuge","source_asin":"B0BKH3H3LN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-510459","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BKH3H3LN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BKH3H3LN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
