window.products.push({"id":510608,"name":"Eco-friendly Burlap Bag brightly Navy color printed Bags with Side Tie closure with Cotton Webbed handles and 18”W X 14” X 5” gusset - Clearance Sale","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51AHnM8I2fL._AC_.jpg","description":"Ouddy Reusable Produce Bags, Set of 12 Premium Lightweight Washable See Through Mesh Produce Bags for Grocery Shopping Storage, Vegetable, Fruit, and Toys, with Tare Weight Tags, 3 Different Sizes About the product: Our mesh bag is made of strong, lightweight, easy-to-see-through mesh. Despite the fruit bag being ultra-thin and transparent, they are very durable and will not tear or fall apart. You can easy to open and close because they have the drawstring toggle closure, which the drawstring is durable and strong and comes with a secure lock to keep contents secure. And they are easy to clean, machine washable. By using this reusable vegetable bags, you can reduce hundreds of plastic bags every year. You can become it to a ball and put in your purse, so that you always have bags to unplanned shopping. It's one more step closer to an ecofriendly zero waste lifestyle and cuts plastic bag use in a convenient way. At the same time, you can save your money and bring you convenient.  Reusable mesh bags can use for shopping or carrying some fruit and vegetable, which you can use it to classify vegetables and fruits products, refrigerated in the refrigerator, to get a longer shelf life. You can also use it to hold travel items and any household item, even grocery shopping, toy storage, hobby supplies, travel, garden harvest, etc.  Our vegetable bag include 3 small bags (12¡± x 8¡±), 6 medium bags (12¡± x 14¡±) and 3 large bags (12¡± x 17¡±). And each mesh vegetable bags has colorful tare weight tags, so you can easily choose size you need before you use it. Include: 12 x reusable produce bags (large medium small) About Ouddy We promise every good effort products to make sure your satisfaction. We make every effort to provide quality services. You could contact our customer service when there any questions. Not satisfied? 100% guaranteed return of goods.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51AHnM8I2fL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ouddy","source_asin":"B00J3ZAFCQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-510608","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00J3ZAFCQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00J3ZAFCQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":510609,"name":"Grounding Mattress Cover for Bed (King Size) with Two Pillow Covers, grounding Sheets for Earthing, Improve Sleep with Clint Ober's GROUND THERAPY Pro","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51bp+hVk0rL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"KING MATTRESS COVER DIMENSIONS: 76\" x 80\" ⇒ WHAT IS GROUNDING ? The earth beneath your feet provides you with food and water. It gives you a surface to sit, stand, walk, run, swim, climb, play, and build on. It also provides you with something very surprising - electrons. When you touch the ground with your bare feet or body, the electrons flow into you. This is called being “grounded.” In our modern society, we no longer sleep on the ground or walk barefoot outside all day like our ancestors did. We wear shoes and live in houses that shelter us from the elements but in doing so, we’ve disconnected ourselves from this important source of electrons. ⇒ WHAT ARE THE BENEFITS OF GROUNDING ? The earth’s surface has a natural negative electric charge. When you touch your body to the ground, it dissipates static electricity and extraneous environmental electrical charges that are on you. At the same time, you receive a charge of energy in the form of free electrons and your body synchronizes with the natural frequencies of the earth. ⇒ IF YOU CAN’T GET GROUNDED OUTSIDE...START EARTHING ! Depending on where you live and what season it is, it’s not always possible to be outdoors barefoot. In that case, and/or to spend more time grounded each day, use Ground Therapy products when you’re indoors. You shouldn’t have to suffer through terrible weather and unsafe conditions to connect to the earth each day. Instead, you can safely and easily connect with our products. ⇒ WHY USE GROUND THERAPY PRODUCTS ? In 1988, grounding pioneer and Earthing founder, Clint Ober, began investigating the natural benefits of grounding. He has worked with and inspired researchers for almost 25 years and developed Earthing systems used worldwide. Ground Therapy products are real, authentic, patent-protected grounding products created by Clint.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51bp+hVk0rL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ground Therapy","source_asin":"B09KJLQ8GY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-510609","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09KJLQ8GY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09KJLQ8GY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
