window.products.push({"id":510643,"name":"Set of 4 Timeless Classic Glass Tree Ornament Boxed Set, White, 3\"x3\"x3\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71E5RklMj2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"CAREFULLY HANDCRAFTED/PREMIUM MATERIALS: Our beautifully handcrafted holiday ornament and hangings will compliment every décor. From simple cottage style to sumptuously lavish, our designers have created an inspired collection of holiday hangings guaranteed to reflect your personal style. Each piece of our hangings is uniquely handmade, using sustainable materials and reflect the individual spirit of the artisan. MULTIPLE STYLES & COLOR OPTIONS: Our holiday ornaments and hangings come in multiple colors and amazing seasonal designs – please check out our store for all available design and color options. We can’t wait for you to unbox them and be delighted! ELEVATE YOUR HOLIDAY DECOR: We promise they will add the perfect je ne sais quoi to any celebration or holiday tradition and bring your tree to life. These unique ornaments are the perfect accessory for the holidays. They add a festive touch and decoration during holidays, Thanksgiving, Christmas, Halloween, birthday parties, family dinner, theme parties, weddings, corporate events, bridal showers, potlucks, brunches, catering events and many other occasions! THE PERFECT GIFT WITH A PURPOSE: Amaze your friends and family by gifting these heirloom accessories while supporting artisan communities in India – they will remember you when they set up that special table. As an added bonus, we invest a portion of our revenues back into artisan communities (building private toilets for women, setting up free eye camps for artisans etc.). Our goal is to enrich artisan communities while bringing these beautiful heirloom quality products to your home CARE INSTRUCTIONS: Clean by wiping with a Soft Damp Cloth.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71E5RklMj2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trunkin'","source_asin":"B09MD3PKWM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-510643","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09MD3PKWM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09MD3PKWM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":510644,"name":"Farberware Edgekeeper Self-Sharpening Triple Riveted Cleaver Knife, 6-Inch, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Sp2i9EUNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Always have the right knife on hand with this Farberware Self-Sharpening Stainless Steel 6-inch Cleaver knife. This knife features a high-carbon stainless steel blade and is perfectly weighed for balance and control while cutting. The knife blade is expertly crafted from superior quality, high-carbon stainless steel, which ensures the blades retain their ultra-sharp edge longer than conventional stainless steel. This knife is the ideal tool for chopping through bones in meat. The handle features stylish triple rivet accents for long lasting comfort. This knife features a built in sharpener, which sharpens blade edge with every use. The sleeve keeps blade edge secure while knife is not in use. Includes: 6-inch Cleaver with edgekeeper sharpening sheath. Hand-wash knives with warm water and a mild detergent then rinse and dry immediately. Stainless steel knives are not dishwasher safe.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Sp2i9EUNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Farberware","source_asin":"B09KXWY9PV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-510644","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09KXWY9PV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09KXWY9PV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
