window.products.push({"id":510803,"name":"Tealyra - brewiTEA - Brew-In-Mug Tea Infuser Mesh Strainer with Metal Dish - Large Capacity and Perfect Size for Hanging on Teapots - Mugs - Cups - To","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91fmql5iJpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"brewiTEA Stainless Steel Tea Strainer Infuser for Loose Leaf Tea Steep, Strain, and Infuse Brew your favorite loose leaf tea, like Gunpowder Green Tea, in minutes. Simply place the tea in your infuser, set the tea steeper in your mug, pour hot water into the infuser, and let steep for 2-3 minutes depending on your tea variety. Placing the lid on unit during brewing will minimize any heat loss, and produce lovely consistent cups of tea every time. Extra-Fine Mesh - Advanced Filtration Say good-bye to debris in your tea forever! The 304 stainless steel mesh is extra fine, so it keeps tea leaves out of your drink. No extra filters or tea bags are needed. Unit holds approximately 20 teaspoons worth of loose leaf tea. Great for brewing one cup, or a full pot. Built to Last With High Quality Stainless Steel Made from eco-friendly rust resistant 304 stainless steel, this is the only tea strainer you will need. This single cup infuser is lead and chemical free. Designed For Usability A lid comes with your purchase to keep the tea hot while brewing. Flip the lid over and use it as a drip tray when the tea filter is pulled out of the mug to keep you counter clean. The heat resistant silicone handles of the infuser will sit on the rim of your mug, making it easy to remove with no worries of heat related injuries. Infuse Fruit, Spices, Herbs & More This infuser is perfect for brewing fruits and fine loose tea such as Rooibos, Oolong, Pu-Erh, Yerba Mate, Herbal, Teavana & Starbucks teas. Make sure the material being steeped is larger than the mesh filter. Brew Coffee In The Mug When brewing coffee, pour the water in slowly. A paper filter is recommended to keep the finer grounds out, but by using course grinds, you allow the coffee oils to pass freely into your cup for maximum benefits.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91fmql5iJpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tealyra","source_asin":"B00OSM431I","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-510803","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00OSM431I","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00OSM431I","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
