window.products.push({"id":510916,"name":"JINAMART Travel Pillow Memory Foam Neck Pillow, Comfortable & Breathable Cover, Machine Washable, Airplane Travel Kit with 3D Contoured Eye Masks, Ear","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81iH+KSEA0S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"We heard your stories of terrible trips, we experienced them ourselves and came up with a solution. Finding the best neck pillow is incredibly important for providing support for sleepy travelers. However, not every travel pillow is made equal. JinaMart Travel Neck Pillow with Inflatable Pillow is the perfect airplane travel kit. This conveniently compact pillow is ergonomically designed to provide neck and head support in travel. When it comes to travel you need to consider, how easy it is to transport the neck pillow? is it comfortable? JinaMart travel neck pillow is made of the highest quality memory foam. Our neck pillow comes with an inflatable pillow. Once packed, the pillow is very convenient to carry JinaMart travel neck pillow is made of 100% memory foam. It is adjustable to any size of neck.  Plush cover is machine washable. It has a high quality zipper that is incredibly smooth. The Travel bag includes; one travel neck pillow, two boxes of earplugs, an eye-mask plus one inflatable pillow. Neck pillow: height - 14.5 cm x weight - 24 cm Dimensions : travel Inflatable air pillow: 20 X 31 X 5.5 cm size of the whole bag :  26 X 12 X 16 cm We had one goal: A luxurious experience for Jinamart’s customers, when we started to build our neck support travel pillows. This is why memory foam is used to make it. They respond gently to pressure, ultra-comfortably, and slowly. 100% SATISFACTION GUARANTEE We’re so sure you’re going to adore your new airplane neck pillow that we’re providing our exclusive guarantee. If you don't find it to offer the best value at the best price, you may return it for a full refund. Your 100% satisfaction is the first priority of Jinamart!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81iH+KSEA0S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JINAMART","source_asin":"B07WP9NCB2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-510916","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07WP9NCB2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07WP9NCB2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
