window.products.push({"id":510966,"name":"ETvalley Hydrometer Dual Scale Salinity Refractometer for NaCl Level (0-100ppt) and Specific Gravity (1.000-1.070) in Aquarium, Sea Water and Salt Wat","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Mdksad6EL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"High quality and reliable refractometer ETvalley salinity refractometer is designed for testing the concentration of salt water and brine and for being used for quality control in aquarium, seafood water tank, or more. The scale of salinity meter provides a direct reading of the specific gravity and concentration (part per thousand) of salt in water. Made by experienced craftsmen and it is unlikely to break down! Keep the important information about water in your mind Check the important units of refractometer aquarium. One scale checks the NaCl levels with the range of 0-100 ppt (with 1 ppt scale divisions) and the other scale gauges Specific Gravity with a range of 1.000 to 1.070(+/-0.001 accuracy). Both enables the direct determination of salinity in water that contains dissolved salt and little or no other dissolved solids. Versatile applicable The refractometer salinity is suitable for a marine saltwater tank. It's fully equipped with ATC that automatically adjust itself to correct temperature discrepancies during use. Capable of measuring with high accuracy and provides precise results. The vivid and sharp reticle chart is for easy and comfortable reading. Packages contains: 1 x Salinity refractometer 1 x Dropper 1 x Wipe cloth 1 x Mini screwdriver 1 x Protective carrying case 1 x Operations manual","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Mdksad6EL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ETvalley","source_asin":"B01MSSURXP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-510966","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MSSURXP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MSSURXP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
