window.products.push({"id":510972,"name":"Migecon Manual Food Chopper with 3-Blades:a Compact and Powerful Hand Held Vegetable Slicer/Dicer as Seen on TV","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616PD57VyeL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"This versatile tool makes us work out of tough cutting tasks quickly, and it's easy to assemble, use and care for. If you hate to get watery eyes when chopping onions, this food chopper will solve it all for you. With the lid on top and onions inside the bowl, you can effortlessly chop away without them making your eyes water.It is the quick and easy way to chop fruits, vegetables, salads in just seconds. Chopper instructions: Easy to use Migecon Manual Food Chopper is a very easy to use machine.1.Carefully place the blade over the center of the bowl.2.Cut the ingredients in crude pieces and place them in the bowl.To ensure best results,fill at most1/4th of bowl capacity with ingredients e.g.a medium sized onion.3.Place the cover on the bowl.4.Hold the lid with one hand and pull the handle with the other hand,until the desired results are achieved.5.Take out the blade carefully before removing food from bowl. Easy to clean: Blades and bowl are top-rack dishwasher safe. Components come apart for easy cleaning. Specifications: Product Formation：A 3 cup capacity bowl+Lid with a cord pulling mechanism+Cutting rotator with 3 ultra-sharp stainless steel bladesMaterial: stainless steel + food grade ABS, PCpackage:1 pc/color boxNet Weight: 200gGross Weight:280g Advantages:1.This mini food chopper's mould and molded parts all manufacturered by our own mould department.2.The all material, we used for mini food chopper is safe and non-toxic.As we have a powerful Technical Team,we are dedicated to providing you with fast , friendly and accurate technical support services. Related products: Adjustable Mandoline Slicer: http://a.co/izTZba3Adjustable Mandoline Slicer with Container:http://a.co/9Odl1SAManual Citrus Juicer: http://a.co/cmXhEtH ( get 33% off now )","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616PD57VyeL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Migecon","source_asin":"B0107OPNLO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-510972","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0107OPNLO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0107OPNLO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
