window.products.push({"id":510994,"name":"casulo Commercial Deep Fryer with Basket 3400W 12.7QT (6.34QT*2) Stainless Steel Countertop Double Electric Oil Fryer for Restaurant & Home Use","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":129.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61U2DHnoaTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"3400W OF COOKING POWER: For ultimate performance, this professional commercial deep fryer equipped with twin immersed heating elements deliver 3400W of cooking power; U-shaped stainless steel heating tubes ensure even heat coverage. Regardless of the occasion, you can use the dual deep fry for preparing a whole range of products (such as fish, wings, chips and nuggets, etc). THERMOSTATIC CONTROLS: Electric deep fryers feature temperature control function and heating indicator light lets you easily create delicious deep fried foods; High-quality thermostats, allows you to select the appropriate frying temperature for a given dish, precise settings from 140℉ to 392℉ (60℃-200℃). Each container has its own control panel and its own power connection. THOUGHTFUL DESIGN: The baskets of the fryer have heat-insulating handle prevents scalding of your hands and easy operation; Special pins for hanging the baskets make it easier to drain the oil; Cold zone prevents food particles from burning and extends the usable life of the oil; Lid cover prevents the boil oil splashing; Non-slip feet stabilise the device. WIDELY USED: Our countertop deep fat fryer is equipped with two 10-litre tanks, each of which can be filled with up to 6 litres of oil that allows you to quickly and effortlessly fry large quantities of food. Both frying containers can be used independently for cooking different foods at the same time. The perfect size allows you to tuck it into any corner on the counter, perfect for light-duty applications like delis, small sandwich shops, concession stands home parties, etc. REMOVABLE PARTS : The deep fryer is really easy to clean, thanks to its stainless steel housing and removable parts. Removable heating element for easy access to the interior; Removable oil tanks, which allow you to conveniently, quickly and efficiently dispose of the oil, are an added plus.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61U2DHnoaTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"casulo","source_asin":"B0B8MRNVJ7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-510994","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B8MRNVJ7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B8MRNVJ7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
